# Factory reset with power loss (journal resume)
name: factory-reset-power-loss
version: 1
description: Power loss during factory reset; reboot resumes and completes reset.

boot
rtc SYNCED 1700000000000
read CHIP-001
crash_identity_store 1
factory_reset
reboot
assert node_id changed
assert incarnation changed
assert observations 0
assert next_sequence 1
read CHIP-002
assert observations 1
assert next_sequence 2